    {
      "id": 16736,
      "name": "Paul",
      "username": "Paul",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-06-06T22:35:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We just got back from UK Games Expo! Christopher, Jenn, Craig, Mara, and I all went and saw lots of awesome people. Christopher and I also spent a ton of time playing Spirit Island and drinking real ale; I really need a nearby pub that serves beer on cask so that I don't have to drive 25 minutes each way just to have a pint.</p><p>Anyhow! We've had a fantastically productive month. Here is a quick summary of things we accomplished:</p><ol>\n<li>Matt organized all of our convention equipment better than it has been in the 6+ years we have been a company.</li>\n<li>Mara, Craig, SaRae, and I attended ACD Games Day in Madison, WI to show off all of our products to their sales people and various attending retailers.</li>\n<li>30 hours after ACD Games Day, Mara, Craig, and I joined up with Christopher and Jenn for UK Games Expo.</li>\n<li>I lost my voice after talking about Spirit Island and Lazer Ryderz for 2 weeks straight.</li>\n<li>We set a new Letters Page record of&nbsp;<span>28,647 monthly downloads.</span>\n</li>\n<li><span>Tons of Gen Con prep work. It is my favorite show of the year, and is always a ton of work, but geez does this years show ever have a lot going on.</span></li>\n<li><span>We finished a bunch of art and minor text writing for the VotM release on the SotM video game.</span></li>\n<li>We finalized so many things! Both OblivAeon and the RPG Starter Kit are very close to done.</li>\n</ol><p>Here is the status of all of our works in progress!</p><p><strong>In Stock Since Last Month</strong></p><ol>\n<li><em>Viva Java</em></li>\n<li><em>Viva Java: The Dice Game</em></li>\n</ol><p><strong>Shipping to Backers</strong></p><ol><li>Nothing this month.</li></ol><p><strong>In Transit; On A Boat</strong></p><ol>\n<li><em>Lazer Ryderz</em></li>\n<li><em>Exoplanets</em></li>\n<li><em><em>Spirit Island</em></em></li>\n</ol><p><strong>In Mass Production</strong></p><ol>\n<li><em>Fate of the Elder Gods<em>&nbsp;(scheduled shipping 26 June)</em></em></li>\n<li><em>Bottom of the 9th: Clubhouse<em>&nbsp;(scheduled shipping 26 June)</em></em></li>\n<li><em>SotM: Stuntman, Benchmark, &amp; Void Guard</em></li>\n<li><em>SotM: Complete Hero Variant Collection</em></li>\n</ol><p><strong>At Factory; Pre-Press Work</strong></p><ol>\n<li><em>SotM: Ultimate Collector's Case</em></li>\n<li><em>SotM: 5th A<span>nniversary</span>&nbsp;Foil Villain Collection</em></li>\n</ol><p><strong>Current WIP Focus by GTG</strong></p><ol>\n<li>Completing&nbsp;<em>OblivAeon</em>\n</li>\n<li><em>Sentinel Comics: The Role Playing Game starter kit</em></li>\n<li><em>Prime War</em></li>\n<li>A new and improved website.</li>\n</ol><p>I'll see you next month!</p>",
